            <ArticleTitle>A serial ultrasound assessment of neoaneurysm following paclitaxel-eluting stent implantation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>e21-2</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case of serial regression of aneurysm of coronary artery complicating paclitaxel-eluting Taxus stent implantation in the mid anterior descending artery evaluated by intravascular ultrasound in a 55-year-old woman.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
